# Knife plane coincident with the bottom face (z=-1) of clay_unit_cube.
#
# Tests the coplanar code path: all intersections with the two bottom clay
# triangles are reported as coplanar and skipped.  The knife is deliberately
# kept inside the cube face (x,y in [-0.5,0.5]) so it does not touch any cube
# edges, avoiding the degenerate edge-on-plane case in the side faces.
#
# With no cut faces produced, classifyFaces has no seed and both outputs will
# be empty — acceptable behaviour for a fully coplanar knife.

v -0.5 -0.5 -1
v  0.5 -0.5 -1
v  0.5  0.5 -1
v -0.5  0.5 -1

f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
